From 2e39abeadd15078c7bc756b78a368592b7859916 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:43:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] FIX copy terminal visual selections from either pane

Terminal visual cursor state carries an anchor so character, block, and forced line yanks copy the selected range instead of falling back to the current line. The behavior stays inside TerminalUi and is covered through UiHarness scenarios for both panes.
---
 src/ui.rs            | 56 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 tests/terminal_ui.rs |  9 ++++---
 tests/ui_harness.rs  | 58 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 101 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

